# W95A: Intern -> Lead. Frozen micro95, 16 MiB RAM, deterministic clock.
# End at 650000000 steps. All make/break events are at least 2 M steps apart.
# Desktop focus: Ctrl+Esc, Esc leaves Start focused; two Tabs return to icons.
# Starts/draw margins were selected on the host with wait-frame-stable and PNGs.
# Solitaire: two deals and ten arrow/Enter/Space actions; Ski: ten directions.
# DOS command launch is attempted, but this seed reports insufficient resources.
# Format: step set-2 hex bytes, or step !shot name; comments follow #.
250000000 !shot desktop
